==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|de|phylogenetisch}}, coined by [[w:Ernst Haeckel|Ernst Haeckel]] in 1866, from {{suffix|de|Phylogenese|isch|nocat=1}}.
From {{prefix|en|phylo|genetic}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|systematics}} Of, or relating to [[phylogeny]] or [[phylogenetics]].
